\title{CDALabeller: Label Cell Death Areas in Agroinfiltration Images}
\description{
An app for annotating cell death areas (CDAs) in agroinfiltration source
images. You draw a bounding box around each CDA and record its treatment.
You also give it a cell death severity score from 0 to 6. The app saves the annotations as a
CSV file that 'AutoCDAScorer' can read.
}
